// Level definitions: three floors as tile grids plus guard patrols.
// Legend: '#' wall, 'C' crate (cover, blocks vision), 'P' pillar, '.' floor,
// 'S' start, 'E' exit, 'I' intel. Guards live in each spec's guards array.
